{"unit_id": "tag:02YT:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n现在正式定义代数空间（algebraic spaces）的Zariski开覆盖（Zariski open covering）的概念。注意，在引理<REF_0001>中，我们已经遇到这样的开覆盖（coverings），作为构造代数空间（algebraic spaces）的方法。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "Zariski open covering", "target_term": "Zariski开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "被覆盖和构造的空间，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski open covering", "target_term": "Zariski开覆盖", "context": "待定义的覆盖，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "开覆盖", "context": "构造空间的覆盖，暂定译法待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02YY:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>Zariski覆盖（Zariski covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0004>，对于<MATH_0005>，由一个集合（set）<MATH_0006>及一族开子空间（open subspaces）<MATH_0007>给出，使得<MATH_0008>是满射（surjective）的层（sheaves）映射（map）。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open subspaces", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "基底概形，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "被覆盖的空间，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski覆盖", "context": "本条定义，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "覆盖索引集，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "open subspaces", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "覆盖的成员，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "覆盖映射的性质，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "覆盖映射的源和目标，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "覆盖给出的层映射，暂定译法待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02YT:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，若<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes），且<MATH_0002>是态射（morphism），则每个纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003>可等同于一个开子概形（open subscheme）<MATH_0004>。定义的最后一个条件恰好意味着<MATH_0005>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n显然，开子空间（open subspaces）族<MATH_0006>，对于<MATH_0007>，是集合（set）（因为<MATH_0008>是位点（site），因而是集合（set））。此外，可以将<MATH_0009>变成范畴（category），取态射（morphisms）为子函子（subfunctors）的包含（inclusions）（由引理<REF_0001>，它们自动是开浸入（open immersions））。最后，定义<REF_0002>给出了Zariski覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0010>的概念，在范畴（category）<MATH_0011>中。因此，正如拓扑空间（topological space）的情形（参见位点（Sites）中的例<REF_0003>），通过适当选择一个覆盖（coverings）的集合（set），可以得到代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0012>的Zariski位点（site）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "open subspaces", "target_term": "开子空间"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "subfunctors", "target_term": "子函子"}, {"source_term": "inclusions", "target_term": "包含"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski覆盖"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "原文保留复数词形，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "测试态射，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "覆盖的基变换，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "基变换表示的子概形，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "open subspaces", "target_term": "开子空间", "context": "构成位点的对象，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "对象集及覆盖集，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "测试位点及Zariski位点，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "开子空间组成的范畴，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "子空间间的包含，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "subfunctors", "target_term": "子函子", "context": "开子空间的函子表示，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "inclusions", "target_term": "包含", "context": "定义的态射，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "包含的性质，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "Zariski covering", "target_term": "Zariski覆盖", "context": "位点中的覆盖，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "类比的空间，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "引用章节名，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "所选覆盖集，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "Zariski位点的空间，暂定译法待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02YZ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>小Zariski位点（small Zariski site）<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对于代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0005>，是上述位点（sites）之一。\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "small Zariski site", "target_term": "小Zariski位点"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "基底概形，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "关联位点的空间，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "small Zariski site", "target_term": "小Zariski位点", "context": "本条定义，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "此前构造的位点，暂定译法待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02YT:prose-0005", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，这给出了某事在代数空间（algebraic space）上Zariski局部成立的含义，这就是我们使用这一概念的方式。一般来说，Zariski拓扑（topology）对我们的目的还不够细。例如，可以考虑代数空间（algebraic space）上的Zariski层（sheaves）的范畴（category）。我们将看到，这并非应当考虑的正确对象，甚至对拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）也是如此。只有使用平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或fppf位点（site），对于<MATH_0001>，来定义拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves），才能得到所需结果。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski", "fppf"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "所讨论的空间，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "Zariski拓扑，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "Zariski层，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "层的范畴，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "需要更细位点的层，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "用于定义层的位点，暂定译法待决。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点", "context": "平展或fppf位点，暂定译法待决。"}], "notes": []}
